units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary f f f
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 single 3.0 5.0 5.0
mass * 1.0
region ball sphere 6.0 5.0 5.0 2.0
dump im all image 1 img.*.ppm type type size 128 128 view 70 20 box no 0 zoom 1.5 region ball forestgreen filled
dump_modify im adiam * 0.4
run 0
